LICENSE — Everyday Dose Frother Fridge Holder
=============================================

This repository contains 3D-printable model files derived from the "Fully
Customizable Pen Holder Fridge Magnet" by Code and Make
(https://codeandmake.com/post/pen-holder-fridge-magnet).

License summary
---------------

* The OpenSCAD source code (`.scad` files) is licensed under the
  **MIT License** — © Code and Make.
* The 3D models / STL geometry is licensed under the
  **Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)** —
  © Code and Make.

Because these files are derivatives of the original project, they use the
same licenses as the original. Use in accordance with your needs, provided
you give credit to the original author.

